result.description:
VeiraMal Consulting is seeking an experienced Insurance Loss Adjuster?to join our clients'?business M Tech Suspension in Footscray. Our client is looking for an enthusiastic individual who can work well in a team, with strong communication skills.

Responsible for: 

- Investigate and assess the cause of loss or damage of vehicles; 
- Ensure that claims are fair and reasonable. 

Key Duties: 

- Inspect damage to vehicles or equipment; 
- Determine the cause of damage; 
- Assess what the insurance policy covers; 
- Estimate the cost of repair or replacement; 
- Interview and negotiate with the claimant on what to do; 
- Liaise with other professionals when required; 
- Authorise payments for claims; 
- Organise and supervise repairs; 
- Negotiate between claimants and insurance companies; 
- Prepare claim reports; 
- Advise on improvements to prevent future incidents; 
- Advise on how to minimise loss of business and help to keep the company trading. 

Performance Appraisal:  Three months after the starting date, then half yearly or when required. 

Qualification & Requirements: 

- Provide Certificate III or above in relevant field 
- Strong understanding of metals, and vehicle body parts 
- Keep up to date with latest methods and technology, industry standards and vehicle compliance matters
- Have an eye for detail 
- Respect for company policies, work ethics and safety standards 
- Good communication and report writing skills 

Salary: $100,000.00 - $120,000.00 + Super

Location: 13 Mephan Street, Footscray 3011, VIC

Only shortlisted candidates will be contacted for an interview.
